    },
    "regime_notes": "Passed benchmark-wide absolute daily paper IC and ICIR gates on the 15-asset cross-asset universe. Positive full-sample relationship, but latest 500-date IC 0.013382 and ICIR 0.042262 are below admission thresholds, so monitor drift and avoid outsized allocation.",
